{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018WDF\u2019 is a horizontal shmup game with a <strong>Boss-rush</strong> style in that the difficulty will increase slightly after the player clears all stages and continues to the next loop. Each loop will be different from the other. Also, it has a main campaign mode with a longer stage and weapon upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.poster.avif?t=1760168291\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.webm?t=1760168291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/c0a66295aeba6aa6dd4f49f320aef03c.mp4?t=1760168291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Moon has awakened\u2014and it is hungry.</strong> No longer a cold rock in space, it radiates an unnatural fire, turning night into an extinction event. The world is burning. <strong>Humanity\u2019s last hope: an elite strike team sent to the Moon to uncover the cause and put an end to it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has two game modes. ( <strong>Main campaign </strong>and<strong> Boss-Rush)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Main campaign </strong>mode offers longer stages and weapon upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Boss-Rush</strong> mode is a shorter stage with a boss that has multiple phases. Each loop adds more phases.</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of players ship with different play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of enemy types, including bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >online leaderboard</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"},{"name":"1CC - A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"},{"name":"1CC - B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"},{"name":"The impossible [ 1CC - C ]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395970?t=1760168291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395970?t=1760168291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/c9a71601b483ff5f8a7f80aadbe5c15d0382e31a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760168291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/c9a71601b483ff5f8a7f80aadbe5c15d0382e31a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760168291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3395980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018WDF\u2019 is a horizontal shmup game with a <strong>Boss-rush</strong> 